OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThis morning will see bright
OL,6,Fspells and one or two light passing
OL,7,Fshowers. This afternoon will be dry
OL,8,Fwith a few sunny intervals. Fresh
OL,9,Fnorthwesterly winds easing this
OL,10,Fmorning and backing southwesterly this
OL,11,Fafternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain will spread from the
OL,14,Fwest later this evening. Becoming
OL,15,Fdrier and clearer in the early hours
OL,16,Falong with the odd shower. Strong
OL,17,Fsouth or southeasterly winds this
OL,18,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
