OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FAfter a mainly dry start,
OL,6,Fshowers or some longer spells of rain
OL,7,Fwill soon spread from the west. Fresh
OL,8,Fto strong west or southwesterly winds
OL,9,Fin the afternoon and evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FEarly
OL,12,Fshowers on Friday before rain spreads
OL,13,Feast for a time in the afternoon,
OL,14,Ffresh to strong southwesterly winds.
OL,15,FWindy with bright spells and showers
OL,16,Fover the weekend.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
